.TH DANBY-MAGNETICPENDULUM2D 1
.SH NAME
danby-magneticpendulum2d \- explore a planar magnetic pendulum
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B magneticpendulum2d
.SH DESCRIPTION
A damped bob moves over three equally spaced magnetic attractors while its
suspension supplies a central restoring force.  Small changes of release point
can select different magnets and produce intricate basin boundaries.
.PP
The left diagram shows the bob, suspension centre, and magnets.  The live plot
shows x and y.  Click a parameter scale to change it, space pauses, period steps
while paused, R resets, and Q exits.
